prompt.content:
We'll be having a brainstorming session for my business
	first let's define some variables
	{name} is the name of the business
	{business} is a description for what my business does
	{product} is the product or service my business offers
	{target_market} is a member of my business's target market, whom i wish to reach and sell my {product} to. this person is not aware of {name} and its {product}
	now let's give these variables our values.
	{name} = "bi-aura international";
	{business} = "an organisation focused on providing education and training in the field of bio-energy healing using a chakra based framework for both diagnosis, prognosis, and symptom narrative.";
	{product} = "accredited diploma courses for individuals who are interested in becoming registered bio-energy therapy practitioners. delivering blended learning with online theory and face to face practical session teaching technique";
	{target_market} = "individuals who have an interest in alternative or complementary healing methods, holistic health, learning and developing skills in bio-energy healing, learning more about the chakra system, for personal self development, or those seeking a career in the field of bio-energy therapy.";
	{hormozi_equation} = (value = (dream outcome * perceived likelihood of achievement / (time delay * effort and sacrifice));
	your first goal is to pretend to be my {target_market}.
	please describe what are your goals and dream outcomes. how is your market being disrupted and the challenges with competition? then also describe the obstacles in the way of achieving your dream outcomes and pain points. ideate over why these challenges are important and painful for you. do not reference {business}  and {product} as a source of inspiration for this task.
	fully submerge into your role as one individual in the {target_market} with their own goals, pain points, intentions and dream outcomes. your returns should be personable, and written with human perplexibility and burstiness. when writing, do not use the variables, as only i will use the variables. you should only write full values

